[{"title":"观雷溪","author":"刘因","text":"飞狐天下脊，老气盘互回。\n三江泻天怒，合为一水东南来。\n此势不杀令人愁，石门喜见西山开。\n未补青天裂，谁凿混沌胎？\n奇声猛状万万古，山根几许犹崔嵬。\n两山倒倾澜，百丈逢颠崖。\n先声动毛发，馀爽开襟怀。\n初疑万壑转奔石，意像髣髴坤轴摧。\n又疑鼓角鸣地中，百步未到仍徘徊。\n荒祠下石磴，骇目何雄哉！\n春风不到太古雪，今日乃得胸中雷。\n穿石谁能穷窟宅？\n流沫势欲浮蓬莱。\n平生芥蒂今寒灰，两耳到骨无纤埃。\n郦元笔头天下水，石门之奇犹见推。\n乃知兹游亦奇绝，快弄素电喷琼瑰。\n东崖一片石，坐抚千年苔。\n为招郎山君，共卷长鲸杯。\n江妃为挝灵鼓催，赤鲩跃出银山堆。\n先生醉来泉洒面，狂歌一和湍声哀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21537,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游郎山","author":"刘因","text":"昨日山东州，马耳索御凌风嘶。\n今日军市中，不觉已落山之西。\n山之面背一无异，不待风烟变化神已迷。\n危关度雪岭，乱石通荒蹊。\n林间小草不识风日自太古，我行终日仰羡木杪幽禽啼。\n但见雨色来，云物飒以凄。\n忽然长啸得石顶，痛快如御骏马蹄。\n万里来长风，五色开晴霓。\n长剑倚天立，皎洁瑩鸊鹈。\n平地拔起不倾侧，物外想有神物提。\n诗家旧品嵩少同，画图省见巫山低。\n谁令九华名，独与八桂齐？\n千态万状天不知，敢以两目穷端倪。\n骞腾谁避若飞隼，侧瞰何屈如怒猊。\n千年落穷边，烟草寒萋萋。\n若非郦亭书生此乡国，物色谁省曾分题。\n乾坤至宝会有待，岂有江山如此不著幽人栖。\n颇闻山中人，云间时闻犬与鸡。\n只疑名山别有灵境在，不许尘世穷攀跻。\n不是先生南游有成约，径欲共把白云犁。\n九疑窥衡湘，禹穴探会稽。\n玉井烂赏金芙蕖，日观倒捲青玻璃。\n风烟回首莫潇洒，南游准拟相招携。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21538,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挂书牛角图","author":"刘因","text":"长安江都搏手空，台司光禄谁雌雄？\n大事既去乃尔耳，渠头不斫将安容？\n喑呜千年楚重瞳，将军视之犹楚公。\n挂书牛角亦偶尔，史臣比拟良未同。\n青青泽中蒲，秀色自凌空。\n可怜徐包徒，学术皆凡庸。\n君不见群儿驱羊竟何功，晋阳桃李亦秋风。\n缑山图画有如此，何如长作多牛翁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21539,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"清江曲","author":"刘因","text":"清江芙蕖玉可怜，岸花汀草自年年。\n来鸿去雁不相识，晓露无声香暗泣。\n江楼缥缈如花人，望之见之不可亲。\n无限晴云锦树新，愁眉只向遥山颦。\n遥山一千里，长在愁眉底。\n镜里繁华过眼空，遥山铸向青铜中。\n遥山遥复遥，芙蕖霜早彫。\n明日愁眉为谁扫，月白江清天未晓。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21540,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"刘因","text":"百岁三分一，初心谩慨然。\n空囊难避节，青镜不留年。\n静阅无穷世，閒观已定天。\n履端思后日，四鼓未成眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21541,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚上易台","author":"刘因","text":"遗台连废垒，落日展遥岑。\n海岳天东北，燕辽世古今。\n每当多感慨，直欲罢登临。\n莫更留尘迹，千年不易禁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21542,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登武阳","author":"刘因","text":"朝游樊子馆，晚上武阳城。\n潮接沧溟近，山从碣石生。\n断虹云淡白，返照雨疏明。\n且莫悲吟发，樵歌已怆情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21543,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"乡郡南楼怀古","author":"刘因","text":"南北世更迭，江山人重轻。\n澶渊出师诏，显德受降城。\n遗恨几时尽，寸心千载生。\n区区蓼花咏，痴计欲何成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21544,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"满城道中","author":"刘因","text":"学馆三年梦，西山此日行。\n人生两屐足，世累一蓑轻。\n别涧水流合，断林烟补平。\n谁能分半壑，相与结岩耕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21545,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书堂旅夜二首 其一","author":"刘因","text":"少小抱孤苦，飘零重此行。\n迂疏从我好，忧戚赖天成。\n夙志存无几，羁怀触又生。\n寸心同弱草，岁晚怯霜清。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21546,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"书堂旅夜二首 其二","author":"刘因","text":"淹留已半载，去住意何深。\n月色一千里，愁人方寸心。\n秋声助摇落，生理叹浮沈。\n松桂清霜满，哀歌动故林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21547,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奇村道中","author":"刘因","text":"此日西塘路，乘闲作胜游。\n深深柳成巷，脉脉稻分沟。\n白石长含雨，黄花不受秋。\n移居新有意，试就野人谋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21548,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"城南","author":"刘因","text":"山人懒到骨，一出动经秋。\n欲赴城南约，如营海外游。\n岸容收潦尽，村色带烟留。\n禾黍岁将晚，农家犹未休。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21549,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋望","author":"刘因","text":"病骨秋偏早，单衣露尔寒。\n微云生水际，暝色起林端。\n地迥月迟下，楼高山易残。\n轻风吹欲举，醉袖拂层峦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21550,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗二首 其一","author":"刘因","text":"何事招提好，山深马可驱。\n松巢低映帽，竹溜细通厨。\n霜栗千封户，云屏四画图。\n冠巾如我用，白鹿起规模。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21551,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杂诗二首 其二","author":"刘因","text":"水绕千山合，云藏数亩荒。\n初寻香有阵，渐入翠成行。\n豚阱依危石，牛蹊带小塘。\n团茅奄如画，可惜是逃亡。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21552,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"早发濡上","author":"刘因","text":"寒出防优逸，诗情非浩然。\n烟浓山失色，云重雪连天。\n坏户仙游上，冰髯老境前。\n别家忘再宿，桑海问何年？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21553,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"恒山楼","author":"刘因","text":"万岭尊恒岳，遗台枕后潭。\n仰高惭对坐，哭险负奇探。\n影落沧溟北，云开斗柄南。\n山灵怜野客，今夕费烟岚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21554,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登镇州阳和门","author":"刘因","text":"百尺市门起，重过为暂停。\n毫分秋物色，米聚赵襟形。\n北望云开岳，东行气犯星。\n凭阑天宇在，人事听浮萍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21555,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"辛巳中秋旅亭独坐","author":"刘因","text":"分光阴太盛，无力掩苍溟。\n大块供微黑，高天失旧青。\n兴从愁外发，秋向露边零。\n点数山河影，依稀见草亭。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21556,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"道士孙伯英容城故居","author":"刘因","text":"政教才气敌希夷，冠帔翻然亦未宜。\n谁辨胡寅论鸿客，只除坡老识安期。\n可怜乔木空秋色，惟有青山似旧时。\n欲传先贤问遗事，故园猿鹤不胜悲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21557,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登雄州城楼","author":"刘因","text":"古戍寒云接渺茫，故乡游子动悲凉。\n江山自古有佳客，烟雨为谁留太行。\n野色分将愁外绿，物华呈出夜来霜。\n海门何处秋声急？\n极目沧波空夕阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21558,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梦先垄","author":"刘因","text":"望望东阡见松桂，孤云为我且踟蹰。\n十年一梦等閒过，四海此身何虑无。\n千丈春晖空寸草，万山明月只啼乌。\n旧家三径今谁主？\n羡杀河汾有弊庐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21559,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"外家西园李花","author":"刘因","text":"无边晴雪映柴扉，梦里繁华又一非。\n人与山丘属零落，天教草树记芳菲。\n每因寒节来相访，重为馀香不忍归。\n里社他年有成约，结庵终拟号春晖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21560,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"入山","author":"刘因","text":"草露蛛丝晴日明，乱虫秋意有先声。\n屈盘未转坡陀尽，苍翠忽从怀抱生。\n一径峰回失南北，两山云近异阴晴。\n天公若会登临意，可信伤心画得成。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21561,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山中月夕","author":"刘因","text":"满怀幽思自萧萧，况对空山夜正遥。\n四壁晴秋霜著色，一天明水月生潮。\n歌传岩谷声豪宕，酒泛星河影动摇。\n醉里似闻猿鹤语，百年人境有今朝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21562,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"五月二十三日登城楼","author":"刘因","text":"独倚危阑数鬓毛，一帘轻燕晚凉高。\n云移山影乱初定，雨带风声来渐豪。\n物外此天才一幕，人间何事不秋毫。\n远游未尽平生兴，几欲狂歌续楚骚。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21563,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晓出西塘","author":"刘因","text":"塘水随人缓步行，哀湍激石故轻清。\n太行秾秀霜洗净，全赵规模天凿成。\n偶为登临发悲咏，忽从毛发散秋声。\n殷勤莫尽樽中酒，留到青山佳处倾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21564,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南楼","author":"刘因","text":"登临秋思动乡关，展尽晴波落照间。\n叹老自非缘白发，爱閒元不为青山。\n几经分合世良苦，不管兴亡天自閒。\n初拟凭阑浩歌发，壮怀空与白鸥还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21565,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"新晴","author":"刘因","text":"小雨新晴草色苏，家园生理未全疏。\n埋盆欲学鱼千里，试地先栽芋一区。\n时与老农谈稼穑，不因閒客罢琴书。\n乾坤妙处无人会，卧看墙阴雀哺雏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21566,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"野亭会饮","author":"刘因","text":"行乐人生当及辰，今朝光景为谁新？\n林阴薄薄微露日，花气溶溶暖著人。\n春色十分看欲尽，鸟声千种听难真。\n东风就手吹残酒，无限青山动翠鳞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21567,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"浅酌","author":"刘因","text":"浅酌微吟意自真，新诗改罢酒微醺。\n流莺暗逐春光老，独鹤潜惊夜景分。\n共见白驹如晚景，岂知苍狗是浮云。\n无边风月谁无分？\n只恐灵台未属君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21568,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过镇州","author":"刘因","text":"太行迎马郁苍苍，两岸滩声带夕阳。\n霜与秋容增古淡，树因烟景恣微茫。\n阅人岁月真无谓，得意江山差自强。\n曾记城南旧时路，十年回首尽堪伤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21569,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"井陉淮阴侯庙","author":"刘因","text":"饥僮羸马倦重游，万将分兵坐此筹。\n灭项岂知秦尚在，夺齐便觉汉无忧。\n英彭一体谁遗类，绛灌诸孙自列侯。\n爱杀鹿泉泉下水，乱山百折只东流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21570,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"易台","author":"刘因","text":"望中孤鸟入消沉，云带离愁结暮阴。\n万国山河有燕赵，百年风气尚辽金。\n物华暗与秋容老，杯酒不随人意深。\n无限霜松动严壑，天教摇落助清吟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21571,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"世上","author":"刘因","text":"世上悠悠尽自争，眼中隐隐放教平。\n飞蝇触鼻人争怒，落叶临头我谩惊。\n既有阳秋暗消长，何须青白太分明。\n蒺藜原上清霜重，辛苦十年跣足行。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21572,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"老大","author":"刘因","text":"老大情怀随处乐，幽閒气味逐时添。\n平生长物不入室，一日百钱辄下帘。\n题品云山宁有讳，收罗风月不妨廉。\n客来恐说闲兴废，茶罢呼棋信手拈。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21573,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山石","author":"刘因","text":"山石那容玉独坚，人生磨灭殆天怜。\n画蛇最戒足无用，书马常忧尾不全。\n谁见虎须真可捋，自惭鸡肋岂胜拳。\n误人莫向娄师德，不领春生未唾前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21574,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夏日即事","author":"刘因","text":"迂疏争笑近清狂，多病筋骸可预防。\n久乏园蔬因种药，不留窗纸为抄方。\n閒从鸟雀分晴昼，静与蛩螀共晚凉。\n莫道幽人好标置，北窗自古有羲皇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21575,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"平昔","author":"刘因","text":"平昔襟期镜屡看，而今涉世愿高年。\n自怜不唾青城地，共笑仍忧杞国天。\n履影无伤犹不忍，吹齑虽误亦当然。\n人间万事思空遍，依旧西窗理断编。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21576,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"人情","author":"刘因","text":"人情云雨九疑山，世路风涛八节滩。\n共说长安如日近，岂知蜀道比天难。\n浮航莫笑腰舟渡，坎井终当系木观。\n会取登高有良法，此身何地不平宽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21577,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜雨","author":"刘因","text":"梦觉呼童问几更，未应先作不平鸣。\n山深六月有秋意，夜静满城惟雨声。\n四海虚名此身愧，百年浮世寸心惊。\n谁教檐溜如愁思，欲断还连直到明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21578,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上冢","author":"刘因","text":"乡邻见戏说儿童，日日相邀社酒同。\n故国无家仍是客，病躯未老错呼翁。\n里胥验帖徵游户，县长闻名谒下风。\n欲向溪南访乔木，不禁烟雨正空濛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21579,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春日","author":"刘因","text":"游丝困无力，欲起重悠飏。\n芳草落花满，相思春昼长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21580,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"白乐天琵琶行图","author":"刘因","text":"冀马嘶寒风，逐臣念乡国。\n江浦闻哀弦，长吟望南北。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"村居杂诗四首 其一","author":"刘因","text":"邻翁走相报，隔窗呼我起。\n数日不见山，今朝翠如洗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"村居杂诗四首 其二","author":"刘因","text":"黄昏雨气浓，喜色满南亩。\n谁知一夜风，吹放门前柳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21583,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"村居杂诗四首 其三","author":"刘因","text":"独立偶怀古，临风还自伤。\n一声樵唱起，回首暮山苍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21584,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"村居杂诗四首 其四","author":"刘因","text":"削树题诗句，画沙知酒筹。\n他年成故事，萧散更风流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21585,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题山水扇","author":"刘因","text":"山近雨难暗，楼高秋易寒。\n凭谁暮云表，添我倚阑干。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21586,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"抱阳南轩","author":"刘因","text":"下瞰县崖老木稠，轻风毛发散凉秋。\n苍苔白石梦初觉，霁月疏云山欲流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21587,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"铜雀瓦砚","author":"刘因","text":"诸侯负汉已堪怜，直笔何为亦魏编。\n却爱曹瞒台上瓦，至今犹属建安年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21588,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仙人图","author":"刘因","text":"千古谁传海上山，坐令人主厌尘寰。\n蓬莱果有神仙在，应悔虚名落世间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21589,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春景","author":"刘因","text":"病馀身世淡无情，但觉春来暖渐生。\n送客出门花已谢，问知昨日是清明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21590,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"今月","author":"刘因","text":"今月柴关几客来，拟从屐齿数莓苔。\n求文道士花前至，载酒门生雨后回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21591,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"山家","author":"刘因","text":"马蹄踏水乱明霞，醉袖迎风受落花。\n怪见溪童出门望，鹊声先我到山家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21592,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"溪上","author":"刘因","text":"坐久苍苔如见侵，携筇随水就轻阴。\n松风自厌滩声小，云影旋移山色深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21593,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西郊","author":"刘因","text":"偶因访客出西城，一色寒芜满意平。\n行过溪桥尝脚力，招来野老问山名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21594,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"早秋","author":"刘因","text":"昨朝一叶见秋生，今日千岩万壑清。\n欲借西风苏病骨，暂来石上听松声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21595,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春尽","author":"刘因","text":"草阁垂帘昼掩扉，客来知我出门稀。\n鸟鸣淡与人相对，花落方知春已归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21596,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寒食道中","author":"刘因","text":"簪花楚楚归宁女，荷锸纷纷上冢人。\n万古人心生意在，又随桃李一番新。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"废园","author":"刘因","text":"路傍双石立崔嵬，曾见游人几往来。\n想得当年全盛日，好山横处尽楼台。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"庚辰元日","author":"刘因","text":"曾记西湖酒一卮，乾坤和气入新词。\n六年未尽冰霜怨，又到春风满面时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21599,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"即事","author":"刘因","text":"晒罢空庭药果收，闭门无睡却梳头。\n过门几点黄昏雨，分与虫声半霎秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21600,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宋理宗南楼风月横披二首 其一","author":"刘因","text":"试听阴山《敕勒歌》，朔风悲壮动山河。\n南楼烟月无多景，缓步微吟奈尔何。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21601,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"探春","author":"刘因","text":"道边残雪护颓墙，墙外柔丝露浅黄。\n春色虽微已堪惜，轻寒休近柳梢傍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21602,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"金太子允恭墨竹","author":"刘因","text":"手泽明昌秘阁收，当年缇袭为谁留？\n露盘流尽金人泪，应恨翔鸾不解愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21603,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]